  "question": {
    "text": "The number of compounds having all atoms in a single plane are<br />\r<br />\r<math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msub></math> , <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msub></math> , <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></msub></math> , <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msub></math> , <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></msub></math> , <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math> , <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><msub><mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msub></math> , <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub></math> , <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub